    "title": "Wellington district tries again with new $17 million school bond - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carina Branson ,\n2 days ago WICHITA, Kan. (KSNW) — Wellington school board leaders voted Monday to move forward with another school bond election. The USD 353 Board of Education approved a special March 3 ballot measure seeking $17.85 million — about $5 million less than the bond rejected in the 2025 general election. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
